  - m_Id: 190000000000000
    m_Localized: <b>Hide and show</b> your task panel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 190000000000001
    m_Localized: Press X on the left controller to hide the task panel, then X again
      to bring it back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 190000000000002
    m_Localized: Press A on the right controller to hide the task panel, then A again
      to bring it back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 190000000000003
    m_Localized: <b>Finish</b> at the lab door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 190000000000004
    m_Localized: 'Teleport to the door and press Y or Menu: in the lab, that is how
      you finish early.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
